WEBVTT

00:11:29.104 --> 00:11:30.564
you are the CEO of Google.

00:11:30.564 --> 00:11:32.114
So where is your priority?

00:11:32.114 --> 00:11:35.034
Do you have issues like we have


00:11:35.034 --> 00:11:38.134
like hitting the sweet spot,
a kind of a balance?

00:11:39.827 --> 00:11:43.827
SP: It's a very good question,
we have to do all of that,

00:11:43.827 --> 00:11:47.287
I try to go back to basic principles.

00:11:47.287 --> 00:11:51.367
We constantly try to find problems
which affect billions of people

00:11:51.367 --> 00:11:54.848
and we try to see how we can use 
technology to solve it

00:11:54.848 --> 00:11:56.928
better than anyone else.

00:11:56.928 --> 00:11:58.488
To give you an example,

00:11:58.488 --> 00:12:02.118
we knew people were taking 
a lot of photos on their mobile phones,